sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Platform Admin
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Operator as ai-gateway-operator<br/>SA: ai-gateway-operator
    participant CertMgr as cert-manager
    participant Kuadrant as Kuadrant<br/>AuthPolicies / RateLimitPolicies
    participant GatewayAPI as Gateway API<br/>HTTPRoutes / Gateways
    participant Istio as Istio<br/>DestinationRules / EnvoyFilters
    participant OTel as OpenTelemetry<br/>Collectors
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus<br/>ServiceMonitors

    Note over Admin, K8sAPI: Control Plane Entry
    Admin->>K8sAPI: Create/Update AIGateway CR<br/>(components.platform.opendatahub.io/v1alpha1)
    K8sAPI-->>Operator: Watch notification<br/>ServiceAccount token auth

    Note over Operator, K8sAPI: Platform State Read
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Get DSCInitialization CR<br/>(dscinitialization.opendatahub.io)
    K8sAPI-->>Operator: Platform init state
    Operator->>K8sAPI: List LLMInferenceServices<br/>(serving.kserve.io)
    K8sAPI-->>Operator: Model serving state

    Note over Operator, Istio: Reconciliation - Networking
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create/Update HTTPRoutes<br/>(gateway.networking.k8s.io)
    K8sAPI-->>GatewayAPI: HTTPRoute applied
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create/Update DestinationRules<br/>EnvoyFilters, ServiceEntries
    K8sAPI-->>Istio: Istio resources applied
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create/Update NetworkPolicies
    K8sAPI-->>Operator: Confirmed

    Note over Operator, Kuadrant: Reconciliation - Security
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Certificate CRs
    K8sAPI-->>CertMgr: Certificate request
    CertMgr-->>K8sAPI: TLS certificate provisioned
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create/Update AuthPolicies<br/>RateLimitPolicies, TokenRateLimitPolicies
    K8sAPI-->>Kuadrant: Policies applied

    Note over Operator, K8sAPI: Reconciliation - MaaS Multi-Tenant
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create/Update AITenants<br/>(maas.opendatahub.io)
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create/Update MaaSSubscriptions<br/>MaaSAuthPolicies, MaaSModelRefs
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create/Update ExternalModels<br/>(inference.opendatahub.io)
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create/Update per-namespace<br/>Roles & RoleBindings

    Note over Operator, K8sAPI: Reconciliation - Batch Gateway
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create/Update LLMBatchGateway<br/>(batch.llm-d.ai)<br/>when spec.batchGateway=Managed

    Note over Operator, Prometheus: Observability Surface
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create/Update ServiceMonitors<br/>PodMonitors, PrometheusRules
    K8sAPI-->>Prometheus: Monitoring config
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create/Update OpenTelemetryCollectors
    K8sAPI-->>OTel: Collector deployed
    Prometheus->>Operator: Scrape /metrics<br/>:8443 HTTPS<br/>TokenReview + SubjectAccessReview
